<title>FRANCE: Imetal sees 1996 net pre-excep profit rise.</title>
<headline>Imetal sees 1996 net pre-excep profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imetal said on Wednesday that it expected a higher 1996 net pre-exceptional profit.</p>
<p>In 1995, this figure came in at 551 million francs.</p>
<p>The prediction came in a results statement in which the group reported first-half net attributable profit up to 317 from 311 million francs.</p>
</text>
